    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i cut my arm on a piece of metal a couple days ago and it wasnt a big deal but now i see this thin red line going up my arm from the cut. i also feel kinda shivery and cold. do i just need to put more neosporin on it or should i be worried?",
