      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont really want to go to the doctor if i dont have to, it's such a hassle and expensive. if i just keep the neosporin on it and maybe take some ibuprofen for the chills, can i just wait a day or two to see if the red line stops moving? i'm mostly fine besides the shivering.",
