      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's literally just a tiny line, it hasn't gone very far yet. i feel like i'm just being paranoid lol. if i take some extra strength ibuprofen and maybe some of that azithromycin my friend has left over from her prescription, wouldn't that take care of it? i'd rather just deal with it at home so i don't have to sit in an urgent care waiting room for hours.",
